      "original_record": "history",
      "value": "Using the values in the table, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X=4\\,\\,\\text{or}\\,\\,Y>4) & =P((X,Y)\\in \\{(2,5),(4,1),(4,3),(4,5)\\}) \\\\  & =P((X,Y)=(2,5))+P((X,Y)=(4,1)) \\\\  & +P((X,Y)=(4,3))+P((X,Y)=(4,5)) \\\\  & =f(2,5)+f(4,1)+f(4,3)+f(4,5) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{9}+\\frac{1}{9}+\\frac{2}{9}+\\frac{1}{9} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
